<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - GOLDMAN STARTS BANK HANDLOWY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GOLDMAN STARTS BANK HANDLOWY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Poland's Bank Handlowy SA with a &quot;market outperformer&quot; rating, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
